      "value": "@{5b07d70c0cac326467244125|full_name}: I agree! There is so much potential for Australians and New Zealanders to be involved in VRC! We are seriously neglected in every way, it really is disappointing!\n\nI would happily pay for VRC+ to put towards server fees if my experience in VRC wasn't unplayable with the outrageously high latency pings!",
